Team 9 — The Ecosystem

This one might be the biggest rival.

Stop trying to find the best representation.

Maintain several incompatible representations simultaneously:

R_1,R_2,R_3,\ldots

Make them compete against problems.

Whichever predicts/solves well reproduces.

Poor representations lose allocation.

Occasional recombination:

R_i\times R_j\rightarrow R_k

Now representation languages themselves undergo selection.

That’s evolutionary epistemology implemented as runtime resource allocation.

Pantheon designs operators.

Ecosystem breeds them.

